0
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Schedule
// When the Crywolf siege starts, and what happens when the cycle ends.
//   Mode: 1 starts the cycle again by itself when it ends; 0 waits for the next row of this part.
//   State: The state the cycle starts in; 1 is the first announcement.
//   Month: The month it starts, 1 to 12. A wildcard means every month.
//   Day: The day of the month it starts, 1 to 31. A wildcard means every day.
//   Day of the week: -1 Every day | 1 Sunday | 2 Monday | 3 Tuesday | 4 Wednesday | 5 Thursday | 6 Friday | 7 Saturday
//   Hour: The hour it starts, 0 to 23. A wildcard means every hour.
//   Minute: The minute it starts, 0 to 59. A wildcard means every minute.
//   Lasts (seconds): A window in seconds after the start time in which the cycle can still start. A wildcard leaves it without a window (unverified).
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~1]    [1~6]    [*/0~12]    [*/0~31]    [*/1~7]      [*/0~23]    [*/0~59]    [Number]
//  Mode     State    Month       Day         DayOfWeek    Hour        Minute      Continuance
//--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    0        1        *           *           4            20          30          *
end

1
//----------------------------------------------------------
// State Times
// How long each state lasts. 1 to 6 are: first announcement, second announcement, ready, siege, end and end of the cycle.
//   State: 1 first announcement, 2 second announcement, 3 ready, 4 siege, 5 end, 6 end of the cycle.
//   Hours: Hours the state lasts. All three parts are added up.
//   Minutes: Minutes the state lasts. All three parts are added up.
//   Seconds: Seconds the state lasts. All three parts are added up.
//----------------------------------------------------------
//  [1~6]    [0~99999]    [0~99999]    [0~999999]
//  State    Hour         Minute       Second
//----------------------------------------------------------
    1        0            0            300
    2        0            0            60
    3        0            0            120
    4        0            0            900
    5        0            0            15
    6        0            0            10
end

