5
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// MVP Score Table
// The score each kill and action gives.
//   Score 1: MVP score a player earns for killing Balgass (monster 349).
//   Score 2: MVP score a player earns for killing Dark Elf (monster 340).
//   Score 3: MVP score a player earns for killing Balram (monster 344).
//   Score 4: MVP score a player earns for killing Soram (monster 341).
//   Score 5: MVP score a player earns for killing Death Spirit (monster 345).
//   Score 6: MVP score a player earns for killing Tanker (monster 348).
//   Score 7: MVP score for each player who holds an altar when the siege ends.
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]
//  Score1        Score2        Score3        Score4        Score5        Score6        Score7
//------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    7000          3000          600           700           600           1000          6000
end

6
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
// MVP Rank Scores
// The score needed for each MVP rank.
//   Rank 1: MVP score needed to reach rank 1. The highest rank reached counts.
//   Rank 2: MVP score needed to reach rank 2. The highest rank reached counts.
//   Rank 3: MVP score needed to reach rank 3. The highest rank reached counts.
//   Rank 4: MVP score needed to reach rank 4. The highest rank reached counts.
//   Rank 5: MVP score needed to reach rank 5. The highest rank reached counts.
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
//  [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]    [0~100000]
//  Rank1         Rank2         Rank3         Rank4         Rank5
//--------------------------------------------------------------------
    0             1001          3001          5001          10001
end

7
